  "statement": "Sustainability is crucial for the autonomous driving system, as it must minimize energy consumption (GRN-01) and utilize renewable energy sources (GRN-02) to reduce its carbon footprint. Implementing lifecycle assessments (GRN-03) ensures that components are sustainable and resource-efficient. Achieving high energy recovery efficiency (GRN-04) during braking is essential for overall energy efficiency, while real-time monitoring of carbon emissions (GRN-05) helps track and reduce environmental impact. Optimizing energy-efficient routing (GRN-06) contributes significantly to operational cost reduction, and establishing emergency protocols to minimize energy use during failures (GRN-07) is vital for sustainability during critical situations.",
